    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_01",
      "hash64": "180463564E510FA1",
      "text": "Das hier ist der Eingangsbereich der\\nBlaubeer-Akademie.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_02",
      "hash64": "180460564E510A88",
      "text": "Diese Schule legt großen Wert auf\\nPokémon-Kämpfe, musst du wissen.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_03",
      "hash64": "180461564E510C3B",
      "text": "Hier auf dem zentralen Kampfplatz finden\\nunter anderem offizielle Kämpfe statt.\\c\\nIst er unbenutzt, steht er allen Schülern zur\\nfreien Verfügung.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "180466564E5114BA",
      "text": "Du solltest hier also öfter Gelegenheit haben\\nzu kämpfen als an anderen Schulen![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_01",
      "hash64": "94C8213947E4A4F8",
      "text": "Ja! Ja, ganz genau. So ist es![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_05",
      "hash64": "180467564E51166D",
      "text": "Mit Ihnen im Nacken wird die Sache nicht\\nunbedingt leichter, Direktor Cyano...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_06",
      "hash64": "180464564E511154",
      "text": "Wo war ich? Ach ja... Die Meeresbrise hier\\nist sehr angenehm.\\c\\nDeshalb verbringen viele Schüler ihre Pause\\nauf den Zuschauerplätzen, selbst wenn gerade\\r\\nkein Kampf stattfindet.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 153,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 180,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_07",
      "hash64": "180465564E511307",
      "text": "Oh! Und es gibt da noch eine andere besondere\\nSache an unserer Schule! Halt dich fest...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_08",
      "hash64": "18045A564E510056",
      "text": "Wilde Pokémon terakristallisieren hier manchmal![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_select_01",
      "hash64": "90548E19E59CB642",
      "text": "Was du nicht sagst!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_select_02",
      "hash64": "90548D19E59CB48F",
      "text": "Aha...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "18045B564E510209",
      "text": "Oh, stimmt ja. In Paldea ist so was ganz normal...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_02",
      "hash64": "94C8243947E4AA11",
      "text": "So ist es. Das Phänomen der Terakristallisierung\\nwurde in Paldea entdeckt.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_03",
      "hash64": "94C8233947E4A85E",
      "text": "Wir haben aufbauend auf dem Terakristall-Orb\\nunsere ganz eigene Technologie entwickelt, mit\\r\\nder sich die Terakristallisierung kontrollieren lässt.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_04",
      "hash64": "94C8263947E4AD77",
      "text": "Und jetzt willst du doch bestimmt wissen,\\nwie wir das erreicht haben, oder?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_10",
      "hash64": "1807E8564E542777",
      "text": "Ähm... Ich glaube, die Erklärung ist leichter\\nzu verstehen, wenn wir uns unten befinden.\\r\\nMeinen Sie nicht auch?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_05",
      "hash64": "94C8253947E4ABC4",
      "text": "Ach, du denkst wirklich an alles![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_06",
      "hash64": "94C8283947E4B0DD",
      "text": "Oooh, ich hätte da eine tolle Idee!\\c\\nWie wäre es, wenn ihr beiden gegeneinander\\nkämpft?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_11",
      "hash64": "1807E7564E5425C4",
      "text": "Was, jetzt sofort?![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_07",
      "hash64": "94C8273947E4AF2A",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Jetzt sofort! Ich würde gerne sehen,\\nwas [VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\r\\nso draufhat.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_08",
      "hash64": "94C81A3947E49913",
      "text": "Tara ist ein Mitglied der Top Vier unserer\\nLiga-AG, musst du wissen. Außerdem ist ihr\\r\\nVater ein Arenaleiter der Einall-Region.\\c\\nVon ihr kannst du sicher etwas lernen![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 171,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_12",
      "hash64": "1807EA564E542ADD",
      "text": "H-Hey, Sie plaudern hier einfach so persönliche\\nInformationen über mich aus...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_13",
      "hash64": "1807E9564E54292A",
      "text": "Das ist ein absolutes No-Go![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_10",
      "hash64": "94C49C3947E18D22",
      "text": "Ich schaue mir euren Kampf gleich aus\\nnächster Nähe an. Hoho![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_14",
      "hash64": "1807E4564E5420AB",
      "text": "Bitte entschuldige... Wenn Direktor Cyano sich\\netwas in den Kopf gesetzt hat, kann man ihn\\r\\nnicht mehr davon abbringen.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_15",
      "hash64": "1807E3564E541EF8",
      "text": "Aber um ehrlich zu sein, bin ich jetzt auch\\nein bisschen gespannt auf unseren Kampf![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_16",
      "hash64": "1807E6564E542411",
      "text": "Hier an der Blaubeer-Akademie werden\\nhauptsächlich Doppelkämpfe ausgetragen.\\c\\nMal sehen, wie du dich darin schlägst.\\nViel Erfolg![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_17",
      "hash64": "1807E5564E54225E",
      "text": "Wahnsinn! Du weißt wirklich, wie man kämpft!\\c\\nUnd ich bin schwer beeindruckt davon,\\nwie jemand aus dem Heimatland der\\r\\nTerakristallisierung sie einsetzt![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 157,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_18",
      "hash64": "1807E0564E5419DF",
      "text": "Wahnsinn! Du weißt wirklich, wie man kämpft!\\c\\nIch hätte nur gerne gesehen, wie jemand aus dem\\nHeimatland der Terakristallisierung sie einsetzt...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_19",
      "hash64": "1807DF564E54182C",
      "text": "Puh, den Sieg konnte ich mir sichern. Ein Glück!\\nDas war ein ganz schön hitziger Kampf, was?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_20",
      "hash64": "17FDD6564E4BB45C",
      "text": "Hier an der Blaubeer-Akademie wurden erst vor\\nKurzem Terakristall-Orbs verteilt. Vielleicht wirst\\r\\ndu mir ja noch ein paar Tipps geben können.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_11",
      "hash64": "94C49D3947E18ED5",
      "text": "Gut gemacht, ihr beiden! Ein wahres Spektakel\\nvon einem Kampf war das![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
