    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_12",
      "hash64": "94C49A3947E189BC",
      "text": "Ach ja! Wir haben übrigens auch eine\\nSchuluniform für dich.\\c\\nHier, probier sie doch mal an, dann fühlst du\\ndich bestimmt gleich als Teil unserer Akademie![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 156,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_25",
      "hash64": "17FDD3564E4BAF43",
      "text": "Sie steht dir super![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_14",
      "hash64": "94C4983947E18656",
      "text": "Schneidig siehst du aus! Nimm doch bitte\\nauch noch das hier an dich.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_headbb_15",
      "hash64": "94C4993947E18809",
      "text": "Mit dieser Karte hast du in den Kleidergeschäften\\nund Friseursalons von Paldea noch mehr Auswahl.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_21",
      "hash64": "17FDD7564E4BB60F",
      "text": "So! Jetzt, wo du richtig zu uns gehörst, wollen wir\\nmal weiter ins Innere der Akademie.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_22",
      "hash64": "17FDD8564E4BB7C2",
      "text": "Du kannst dir an den Schranken dort drüben\\naussuchen, wohin du möchtest.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_23",
      "hash64": "17FDD9564E4BB975",
      "text": "Dann bekommst du auch die weltberühmte\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Tera-Kuppel [VAR 0xFF00(0000)]der Blaubeer-Akademie zu sehen![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc02_0050_fairybb_24",
      "hash64": "17FDD2564E4BAD90",
      "text": "Geh einfach zu einer der Schranken und\\nbegib dich zur [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Tera-Kuppel[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
